      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: Disagree, while better culling would probably be useful, it still would not have the drastic FPS increase this feature has. If I'm sitting at the back looking towards 70 people, better culling won't do a single thing to help my fps. Giving me what is essentially an inverted safety bubble, however, would.",
