      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sliders should not only go up to 50m and 30 Avatars. In Bigger worlds i might want to see further away than 50m but not infinity far. Same with  how many avatars i wanna show. with more performant PC i might be able to show more than 30 Avatars but not 80. Would be nice to adjust slider range up to 80.",
